stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Submitted : Citizen submits (ref ID generated)
  Submitted --> UnderReview : CMO takes up for review
  UnderReview --> InProgress : CMO assigns department + officer
  InProgress --> InProgress : Officer investigation remark
  InProgress --> InProgress : Officer submits report
  InProgress --> Resolved : CMO accepts report
  InProgress --> InProgress : CMO sends report back
  Resolved --> Reopened : Citizen reopens with reason
  Resolved --> Resolved : Citizen feedback (status unchanged)
  Reopened --> UnderReview : CMO re-reviews
  Reopened --> InProgress : CMO reassigns directly

  state "Submitted" as Submitted
  state "Under Review" as UnderReview
  state "In Progress" as InProgress
  state "Resolved" as Resolved
  state "Reopened" as Reopened
